{"c":[{"id":"6aeaadf7a5a96e75","sum":"Hardware input shows only as powerd's UserIsActive in pmset -g log (B5). The helper sees one window departure up to 3 times (appSwitch, leave walk, focus elsewhere): count per departure; a return is a focused walk of a departed window.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T173801Z-d9e0d3a584c9d36e","text":"Human activity on this Mac: only powerd's UserIsActive 'kernel.useractive' in pmset -g log marks hardware input; agents' posted events raise WindowServer per-process assertions, and WindowServer per-device ones stay raised for days (B5).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T173802Z-3bfd0ad97555af7b","text":"Helper reports one window departure up to three times (appSwitch, leave walk, focus elsewhere); count per departure, and detect a return as a focused walk of a departed window, since focusedWindowId does not change across an unreadable app.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7e4af4b925d02c75","sum":"Read the shadow store only via sqlite3 'file:...?mode=ro' .backup to a temp copy (opening it as Store writes a salt). Agent sidebars (T3, Codex) keep a 'Working' status for a thread's life: pending markers come from structure, not status words (B6).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T173802Z-57d66219a60e6cdb","text":"Read the shadow store only through sqlite3 'file:...?mode=ro' .backup into a temp copy; opening a data dir as Store creates a salt file and chmods it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T201044Z-85ef58a913b9161a","text":"T3 Code and Codex list other agent threads in a left sidebar, each a button holding a status text ('Working') that lasts the thread's life; pending markers must come from structure (enabled stop button by the composer), not status words (B6 census).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
